  "item_short_desc": "<p>Elevate your winter wardrobe with Rothco's Quarter Zip Acrylic Commando Sweater. Crafted from high-quality acrylic, this sweater offers exceptional warmth and comfort for outdoor adventures or everyday wear. Its quarter-zip design adds a touch of classic style while providing convenient temperature control. Whether you're hiking through the wilderness or running errands around town, this sweater keeps you warm and comfortable.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
