  "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Elevate your winter wardrobe with Rothco's Quarter Zip Acrylic Commando Sweater. Crafted from high-quality acrylic, this sweater offers exceptional warmth and comfort for outdoor adventures or everyday wear. Its quarter-zip design adds a touch of classic style while providing convenient temperature control. Whether you're hiking through the wilderness or running errands around town, this sweater keeps you warm and comfortable. The durable acrylic fabric ensures long-lasting performance, while the versatile design makes it suitable for various activities and occasions, such as camping, hiking, or traveling for the weekend. This 1/4 zip sweater is great for either wearing on its own or as a layer underneath one of our MA-1 Flight Jackets, Parkas, or Spec Ops Tactical Fleece Vests. Stay warm and comfortable in style with Rothco's Quarter Zip Acrylic Commando Sweater.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
